Error [E0120]: `action` was not moved here, so it cannot be returned as-is
  --> tests/ui/function_contract_laundering.jet:3:56
    |
  3 | fn erase(action: fn(Bool) -> Int) -> fn(Bool) -> Int { action }
    |                                                        ^^^^^^
 Why: This function has read access only and does not own the value
 Fix: Return a copy: `return ~action;` — or take ownership with the move marker `^`: `action: ^fn(Bool) Int`. To return borrowed data, declare `-> View<T> from action` and return a view derived from `action`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0120

