 Why: This function has read access only and does not own the value
 Fix: Return a copy: `return ~action;` — or take ownership with the move marker `^`: `action: ^fn(*, force: Bool) Int`. To return borrowed data, declare `-> View<T> from action` and return a view derived from `action`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0120

Error [E0771]: This needs fn(*, force: Bool) Int, but the function value is fn(Bool) Int
  --> tests/ui/function_contract_laundering.jet:10:29
    |
 10 |     plain :: erase(labelled(save))
    |                             ^^^^
 Why: Public labels and parameter zones are part of a function's callable type
 Fix: Use `fn(*, force: Bool) Int` here
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0771

